      "component": "KitFaq",
      "data": {
        "kicker": "Questions",
        "title": "New to Mumbai: common questions",
        "items": [
          [
            "Is it weird to go on my own?",
            "Not at these. Hosts plan for people coming alone: groups, teams and tables are made for you, and first-timers get a hello."
          ],
          [
            "What’s the easiest first plan?",
            "A free Sunday run or a pub quiz. Both put you in a group straight away and last about two hours."
          ],
          [
            "Do I need the app?",
            "No. Book, pay and check in on the website in your phone’s browser."
          ],
          [
            "How do I keep meeting the same people?",
            "Go back to the plans you liked and follow the host. Regulars are how friendships start."
          ],
          [
            "Will hosts message me?",
            "About the plan you booked, yes: where to be and any changes. Anything else, like news of their next event, only if you say yes."
          ],
          [
            "What if I can’t make it?",
            "Cancel from your booking. Refunds follow the host’s cancellation policy, shown before you book."
          ]
        ],
